                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is quite mindless; in a good way.\nYou basically pick a stage, pick a weapon and shoot at big Minecraft blocks.\nOnce you've destroyed all of the big Minecraft blocks, you play the stage again, but this time you have your Mario Kart replay ghost shooting with you.\nThis loop continues until you either quit the game, or your computer overheats, explodes, catches on fire, etc.\nAlso the game looks like it was made with assets from the Unity marketplace.\n\nAnyway, I rate this game a My computer has flames coming from it, I'm typing this review on my laptop/10.\n\n(I haven't played this game since the 14th of June 2019.)",
